<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Review_Page_Button_Label__c</fullName>
    <defaultValue>&apos;Continue to Review&apos;</defaultValue>
    <description>The text of the button that opens the review page when the review screen is on: the Stages Mode overview button once all required stages are complete, or the last visible page's forward button in page-by-page forms. The submit button on the review page itself uses Submit Button Label. Blank shows Continue to Review. Upgrade note: this field once labeled the review page's submit button, so a template that set it should now also set Submit Button Label. Picklist values, so Translation Workbench translates them.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Choose the wording on the button that opens the review page, such as Continue to Review or Review &amp; Submit. Respondents click it after finishing the form pages; the final submit wording on the review page itself comes from the Submit Button Label field.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Review Page Button Label</label>
